    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: All media on this page is subject to change; visuals for the game are still in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an odd building that seems to go on forever; the rooms of the building vary in theme, going from industrial storage rooms and halls to retro mall wings and arcades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the building, you may encounter other beings that aren't just other people. These beings may not all communicate or display any real signs of thought or intelligence, but they all seem to be aware of a couple things. They don't know where they are, they don't know how they got there, and they're scared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I'm Not Scared</i>\u00a0is a multiplayer roguelike horror game that incorporates psychological horror and is heavy on worldbuilding and exploration. Navigate the vast building with your friends as you explore various environments, encounter the beings that reside within the building, and<i> save <strong>them</strong></i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each successful round of the game, various elements are introduced that stir up the gameplay; higher enemy quantity and aggression, random gameplay modifiers, and larger maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are a few other things the world of\u00a0<i>I'm Not Scared</i>\u00a0has to offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new massive procedural generated map every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and experience the vast emptiness and mystery of the building, or venture the place with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk (or scream) with your friends via proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unseen rooms and areas, learn about world and the beings inside of the building</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why you can't escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info will come shortly- thank you for visiting the page!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: All media on this page is subject to change; visuals for the game are still in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/4418565519d5ba691d07d7ecfeec7fe1.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an odd building that seems to go on forever; the rooms of the building vary in theme, going from industrial storage rooms and halls to retro mall wings and arcades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/5bd857d1c4f661388acb372ec4babf3d.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the building, you may encounter other beings that aren't just other people. These beings may not all communicate or display any real signs of thought or intelligence, but they all seem to be aware of a couple things. They don't know where they are, they don't know how they got there, and they're scared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.poster.avif?t=1750270205\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.webm?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619480/extras/047953e6e7b69058156471ccc307c260.mp4?t=1750270205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I'm Not Scared</i>\u00a0is a multiplayer roguelike horror game that incorporates psychological horror and is heavy on worldbuilding and exploration. Navigate the vast building with your friends as you explore various environments, encounter the beings that reside within the building, and<i> save <strong>them</strong></i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each successful round of the game, various elements are introduced that stir up the gameplay; higher enemy quantity and aggression, random gameplay modifiers, and larger maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are a few other things the world of\u00a0<i>I'm Not Scared</i>\u00a0has to offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new massive procedural generated map every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and experience the vast emptiness and mystery of the building, or venture the place with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk (or scream) with your friends via proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unseen rooms and areas, learn about world and the beings inside of the building</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why you can't escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info will come shortly- thank you for visiting the page!</p>",
